Statement of changes (GPL-3.0 section 5a)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Modifications by SerpentX (2025-2026), also licensed under GNU GPL v3.0, add:
true simultaneous dual-pool SHA-256d mining with a configurable per-pool
hashrate split, a custom per-pool password field, per-pool failover, prebuilt
binaries with a hosted web flasher, and an in-UI "Release & Update" panel that
points at this project's releases. The complete, dated list of changes is the
git commit history of this repository.

